roma, summarizing the definition, causes, and clinical features. I am documenting features like burning pain, numbness, and feeling of a pebble in the shoe. I'm focusing on the management, including footwear modifications, activity changes, and possible injections, to extract all useful details.\n\n\n","truncated_fields":["content","thinking"]}
